 "text": "Buckley Bros Inc. – Since 1904\nSkip to content 320 E. Main Street\nWilmington, OH 45177\n(937) 382-2566\nAbout Us\nLocations & Dealers\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nProducts\nContact Us\nDTN Tools/Grain Market Cash Bids\nFutures\nWeather\nNews\nAbout Us\nLocations & Dealers\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nProducts\nContact Us\nDTN Tools/Grain Market Cash Bids\nFutures\nWeather\nNews\nWelcome to Buckley Bros Inc.!\nProviding unrivaled customer service for over 100 years.\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nLearn more about Buckley Bros' signature line of custom in-house feed mixes.\nExplore our line\nLocations and Dealers\nFind a BBI location or a certified distributor near you!\nfind a location\nProducts we Carry\nBuckley Bros. Inc. distributes Purina, Sportmix, Science Diet, Diamond, Iams petfoods, and more!\nour trusted brands\nWelcome to Buckley Bros Inc.!\nProviding unrivaled customer service for over 100 years.\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nLearn more about Buckley Bros' signature line of custom in-house feed mixes.\nExplore our line\nLocations and Dealers\nFind a BBI location or a certified distributor near you!\nfind a location\nProducts we Carry\nBuckley Bros. Inc. distributes Purina, Sportmix, Science Diet, Diamond, Iams petfoods, and more!\nour trusted brands\nWelcome to Buckley Bros Inc.!\nProviding unrivaled customer service for over 100 years.\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nLearn more about Buckley Bros' signature line of custom in-house feed mixes.\nExplore our line\nLocations and Dealers\nFind a BBI location or a certified distributor near you!\nfind a location\nProducts we Carry\nBuckley Bros. Inc. distributes Purina, Sportmix, Science Diet, Diamond, Iams petfoods, and more!\nour trusted brands\nAbout Us\nBuckley Bros., Inc. was originally started in 1904 by brothers George and Parker Buckley. They had operated a wheat buying station in the village of Kingman, Ohio prior to their move to Wilmington, Ohio.\nThe brothers purchased an elevator which had been built circa 1899 at the current location of 320 East Main Street in Wilmington. The business at that time consisted of buying and shipping wheat by rail or trading wheat for bran, middlings, and/or flour. Another vital part of their business consisted of supplying horse customers with oats, corn, and hay. Three people were employed at that time…\nMore about our rich history\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nCattle Feeds\nHorse Feeds\nDeer Feeds\nGoat Feeds\nPoultry Feeds\nRabbit Feeds\nSongbird Feeds\nSheep Feeds\nSwine Feeds\nBrands We Carry\nMarket Data\nLocal Weather\nJoin us on our Facebook page!\nFind a Location\nGet in Contact\nSign up for our email newsletter\nAbout Us\nLocations & Dealers\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nProducts\nContact Us\nDTN Tools/Grain Market Cash Bids\nFutures\nWeather\nNews\nAbout Us\nLocations & Dealers\nBetr-Bilt Feeds\nProducts\nContact Us\nDTN Tools/Grain Market Cash Bids\nFutures\nWeather\nNews\nPrivacy Policy\nMain Office\n320 E. Main Street\nWilmington, OH 45177\n(937) 382-2566\ntoll free: (800) 800-2566\nCopyright © 2026 Buckley Bros Inc. All Rights Reserved.\nWebsite Design by The VAN LEUVEN Company",
